repository-code: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Ink
abstract: >
  ZPE-Ink is a deterministic digital-ink codec centered on the .zpink packet
  format. It encodes stroke streams — pressure, tilt, timing — identically
  across every runtime using 8-direction Freeman chain codes packed as 4-bit
  nibbles.
